{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（4日）上午11時，警方接報指旺角花園街100號一間麻雀館發生火警，據報一名29歲男職員疑使用香薰機時燒傷面部，神智清醒。消防到場將火救熄，傷者經由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。</p><p>現場消息指，該名男職員每日都會為香薰機注入精油，疑意外搶火，導致面部燒傷。他送院時頭髮燒焦，面部需要敷上敷料。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者的頭髮亦被燒焦。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260804/1161278428754874368397640.jpeg/xl_jljCZLmb-GjDjhQwSIWuT_I5YRk7LLAqhXCwKoVw\"/><figcaption>傷者的頭髮亦被燒焦。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者面部燒傷，需要敷上敷料。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260804/1161278426141691904756014.jpeg/0l0hxewSDZsrsuz8TnqY1pZnm1a2nBUGFQIu_BUCLvw\"/><figcaption>傷者面部燒傷，需要敷上敷料。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是花園街100號一間麻雀館。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260804/1161274640501444608631927.jpeg/FYmi1oXSNEylc_xyRkO2-Lz651o83amy_zraANo62gA\"/><figcaption>現場是花園街100號一間麻雀館。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260804/1161274637519163392801679.jpeg/Cno_RiFfSpDB2eSuBnbjluiM45-eMX0TlW03T7BtN08\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者被送到廣華醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260416/1121454825783955456675301.jpeg/hnx7PMFg4gfs15A2VqHQLzxRgq-4RTdHlZMy8JWTMvA\"/><figcaption>傷者被送到廣華醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T04:01:19.147999+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}